ar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's still no reason to let writer's block get to you, though. Just keep those letters coming, no matter how absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, you won't get fired, and your wages only increase.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras/feb366db93d3058be3d882774ee581ee.avif?t=1764169311\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras_big/feb366db93d3058be3d882774ee581ee.avif?t=1764169311 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras/9f3b4aff9a831b3a4791f5575ff576e9.webp?t=1764169311\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building on the free version of Ghostwriter Workshop as Episode 1, this version adds Episodes 2 through 5 to greatly enhance the game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras/9b7bddd693ccc615fd90cb6c88f71ba9.avif?t=1764169311\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras_big/9b7bddd693ccc615fd90cb6c88f71ba9.avif?t=1764169311 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br> Starting in Episode 2, you can explore the town in search of words in line with your clients' requests. Listen closely to what these 11 quirky characters have to say, and search for the best words using roulette! Most of the time, your efforts are ruined thanks to you memorizing uncalled-for expressions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras/f22d8c684466cab2eb6c1391c38cd93d.avif?t=1764169311\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342800/extras_big